Source: https://github.com/trycua/cua
Commit: ecaf10b (2026-11-04)

The Agent Cursor's motion (internal/win/cursor_motion.go,
cursor_layout.go, cursor_raster.go, cursor_view.go; cursor-look spec,
ADR 0018) port, modified for winuse. Since cursor-look issue 11 the arrow
is no longer cua's (it is drawn after Mural's presence cursor) and its
palette is our own; the trail keeps cua's widths and lifted colour.

- libs/cua-driver/rust/crates/cua-cursor-motion: the signature_arc path
  (path.rs, spec.rs, params.rs), the steady timing's in-out sine and
  600 ms floor (plan.rs, style.rs), bump_profile (ease.rs), the Fitts
  duration and the arrival (plan.rs arrival_t), the reduced-motion move;
- libs/cua-driver/rust/crates/cursor-overlay: the lean rotation (travel_rotation, cursor.rotate=lean) and the
  float (cursor_pose.rs), the click's press keyframes
  (build_default_theme.py action_click) and the trail (effects.rs);
- libs/cua-driver/rust/crates/platform-windows/src/overlay.rs: the timer
  resolution raised only while frames run.

